  "policy_type": "cloud",
  "source_text": "Cloud Platform Access Policy\n\nDevelopers can read source code repositories.\nDevelopers can deploy to staging.\nOnly DevOps engineers can deploy to production.\nDevOps engineers can deploy to production only between 10pm and 6am.\nAdministrators must use MFA to access production servers.\nDatabase administrators can manage production databases from managed devices.\nService accounts cannot delete backups.\nContractors cannot access secrets unless they are on the VPN.\nInterns cannot access production.\n",
